{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become a spy master and manage a systems-wide interstellar agent business. Manipulate a corporate network by stealing and selling data and technology to become the richest operative in the galaxy.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 different characters with versatile strategy affecting attributes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast corporate network that develops according to your operations and data sales</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankruptcies, liquidations and stolen bases</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retaliations from corporations against your operations</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Agents destroyed, vendettas issued and operations blocked</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of technologies to steal and develop</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated universe where each run is unique</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/351936827dc7cf7e905cbe9c16dd07a7.poster.avif?t=1769428193\" width=1170 height=456 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/351936827dc7cf7e905cbe9c16dd07a7.webm?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/351936827dc7cf7e905cbe9c16dd07a7.mp4?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Focus your tactics and strategy with your character choice. Spymasters develop relationships easy with corporate CEOs with betrayals causing a quick fallout. Cryptographers are more powerful in combined operations, while crackers work from the shadows, receiving less bonuses but also less penalties from corporate actions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.poster.avif?t=1769428193\" width=780 height=194 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.webm?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/436bcbf23fc32d5519515b69d6a50551.mp4?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a randomly generated universe with your trusted probe. Find planets, asteroids and space stations. Expand your empire by building relays, operations hubs and admin centers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.poster.avif?t=1769428193\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.webm?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/f4171e19924c84df7941aa1979796c23.mp4?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch operations from your hubs, target planets and their corporations to steal their data. Target corporations with multiple agents to maximize your success.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.poster.avif?t=1769428193\" width=780 height=262 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.webm?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/7a2be37e2dac6aa5aff29d8ee22ec262.mp4?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell the stolen data to the highest bidder - or keep the data to yourself to keep a corporation from gaining too much influence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/42a24db59dd980d56e6b6c6ea1b4a511.avif?t=1769428193\" width=1035 height=132 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See your data go to good use as you change the corporate landscape by strategic sale of information.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.poster.avif?t=1769428193\" width=780 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.webm?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563480/extras/13df498dfcf0fc7bbb3e45e84500d98f.mp4?t=1769428193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and steal technology, develop it and put the technology to good use - spying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make enough money to earn your retirement on a private planet - or end up failing and bumming it on a cheap asteroid with your space dog.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reached year 10","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steam